    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mizengo ya Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī mu mbūga ya Moabu, bbihī na mongo gwa Yolodani, ī lipandī īlo lyalī liilolile na Yeliko, ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A Baisilaeli binhage shiishi shilagīlo. Ībigeleelilwe kūbinha mizengo a Balawī; bapandīke ha kwikala ū mu sī ya wingīji, īyo balayīpandīke a Baisilaeli. Hama babinhe na madīīmīlo gabize hihī nī mizengo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko nabo bakūpandīka mizengo yabo ya wikomangīle, na madīīmīlo ga mitugo jabo; bayūdīīmīla mo ī ng'ombe jabo nī ng'holo, nī mitugo ī jingī ījo baalī najo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A madīīmīlo ayo mulabinhe a Balawī, ayo gīpīndije ī mizengo yabo, gakūdaha ibbaala lya kūbiza na miita gītī magana anè na makūmi atanò ū kwīnga aho gūgelelile ū nzengo ū kūja ī hanze, kūgūpīndīlīja ū gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma nī hanze ya nzengo mukūbala miita magana kenda ī lipandī ī lya Kīīya, nī lya Dakama miita magana kenda, nī lya Ng'weli magana kenda, nī lya Sukuma magana kenda; ū nzengo gwenekīlī gūbiza ha gatī gatī. Ī libbaala lyenīlo īkūbiza sabo ya mizengo yabo kūlwa kūdīīmīla mitugo jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mizengo īyo mukūbinha a Balawī, ītandatū īkūbiza ya kūpeelela ūlū munhū ūbūlaga; hama a Balawī benabo mukūbinha na mizengo yīngī makūmi anè n'ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ī yose īyo mukūbinha a Balawī īkūbiza makūmi anè n'īnaane, kūgasanja mo na a madīīmīlo gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo īyo mukūbinha a Balawī kūfuma ū mu sī ya wingīji wa Baisilaeli, shiigelile ījīlanīje nī sī ya wingīji ya būlī lūganda. Ūlū lūganda lūlī na mizengo mingī, mukūsola mizengo mingī kūfuma mo, alīyo ūlū lūganda lūlī na mizengo migeehu dūhū, mukūsola migeehu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mizengo ya kūpeelela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla hangī ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngaga nabo a Baisilaeli ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūlū ng'ūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani ng'wingīla ū mu sī ya Kanani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukūsolanhya mizengo ng'wītūūle kūbiza ying'we ya kūyūpeelela; ūko munhū adūgije kūpeelela ūlū ūbūlaga munhū ūngī kūlwa kūhūbīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo yenīyo īkūtūmama kūlwa kūmpeela maji wa shiilī; īkūbiza ya kūpeelela ko ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī wabūlagaga, atizūbūlagwa aho ataalī kūdegelekwa ha lūbanza lwa balamuji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ītandatū īyo mulīyīsolanhya yenīyo, gakūbiza mapandī ga kūpeelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū lwande ūlū ū lwa mongo gwa Yolodani mukūsolanhya mizengo idatū, nī lipandī lya Kanani ng'ūsola idatū koi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo ya kūpeelela yenīyī īkūbiza kūlwa Baisilaeli bose, pye na a bageni, na a bangī abo bakwikalaga hamò nabo. Ose ose ūyo ūbūlaga munhū mu kūhūbīla, akūpandīka ha kūpeelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo ūntūla munhū na līīchūūma ūmūlaga, ū ng'wenūyo mūlagi; ū mūlagī shing'wigeleelile kūbūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ūyo ūbūūcha iwe mu nkono īlo līshikile kūbūlaga, hūna ūlītūmamīla kūntūla munhū ūmūlaga, ū ng'wenūyo nang'hwe mūlagi; ū mūlagi shing'wigeleelile kūbūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo alī na līntī mu nkono īlo līdūgije kūbūlaga munhū, hūna ūlītūmamīla kūntūla munhū ūmūlaga, ū ng'wenūyo mūlagi; ū mūlagi shing'wigeleelile kūbūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūūmaji wa shiilī akūmūlaga ū munhū ū mūlagi; ūlū ūmpandīka shing'wigeleelilwe amūlage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ang'wikanilwe ng'wiye, hūna ūnchima līshikolo, nūūlū ūng'wibandīīla hūna ūmponda na līshikolo ūntūla ūmūlaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū ūntūla ngumī kūlwa nguno ya wanishi ūbo alī nabo kūlī we, kūshisha ūmūlaga, ū munhū ng'wenūyo shing'wigeleelilwe abūlagwe, nguno mūlagi ū ng'wenūyo. Ū maji wa shiilī shiigelil amūlage ū mūlagi ūlū ūmpandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū munhū ūhayimanīla wanchima ng'wiye līshikolo, nūūlū alīponya līshikolo, hūna lyūkantūla alīyo atī na wanishi bose bose nang'hwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūūlū aho atūmonaga ūntūla iwe īlo līshikile kūbūlaga, na ng'hana ūcha; ū munhū wa gīko īkī walī atī na nhungī yose yose ū kūlī ng'wiye, nūūlū walī atī ng'wanishi wakwe, hū kūhaya walī atī na nguno yose yose ya kūmūlaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho ū lūbanza lwa balamuji lūkūbalola chiza, ū mūūlwa nū maji wa shiilī. Ī mihayo yabo īkūlolwa kūlenganīla nī shilagīlo shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile ū lūbanza lūngunīje ūyo alībūūlwa gīkī mūlagi, lūnang'hane atizūbūlagwa nū maji wa shiilī. Bakūnshosha ū kū nzengo gwa kūpeelela ūko walī wapeelelile. Ū mūūlwa ng'wenūyo shing'wigelilwe ikale kwenūko kūshisha kūcha kwa ngabīji ntaale, ūyo itīīlilwe maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mūūlwa ūlū ūfuma ū mu mbīmbī ja nzengo gwa kūpeelela, ūko walī wapeelelile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ū maji wa shiilī ūmona alī hanze ya nzengo gwenūyo, ū maji wa shiilī ūlū ūmūlaga ū munhū ng'wenūyo, atūsolwa būbi gīkī wabūlagaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mūūlwa shing'wigeleelilwe kwikala ū mu nzengo gwa kūpeelela, kūshisha ache ū ngabīji ntaale; ūlū ūcha ū ngabīji ntaale, nang'hwe lūūlū adūgije ū kūshoka ū kū malaale gakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būkaanīji kūlwa būbūlagi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
