            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kalī kihelele ka shilagīlo īsho shikūmulang'hana makanza gose, nū mu shibyalīlwe īsho shiliza, hose hose ūko mulabize: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūbūūlwa gīkī mūlagi, nang'hwe akūbūlagwa kūlwa būkaanīji wa banhū abo balīnkaanīla. Alīyo atīho nūūlū ūmò wa kūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būkaanīji wa munhū ūmò dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya kwanukūla shose shose sha kūkomoola būpanga wa mūlagi ūyo igeleelilwe kūbūlagwa; ū munhū wa gīko nekagi abūlagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya nūūlū kwanukūla shikomoolelo shose shose kūfuma kūlī munhū ūyo wapeelela kū nzengo gwa kūpeelela, gīkī hīmba ashoke kū malaale gakwe, alīyo ū ngabīji ntaale ataalī ū kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī īyo mukwikala yaya ū kwīsosohaja. Ū witi wa mininga būkīsosohajaga ī sī; na gūtīho mhayo gose gose gwa kwībeegeja isangī ī sī ūlū yūlinda yidīkīlwa mininga; ūlū ītī kwitwa dūhū nago a mininga gakwe ūyo witaga mininga ga ūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī īyo mukūjiikala yaya ū kwīsosohaja; nguno ī yoi īlī wikalo wane, ū nene SEEBA ūyo nakwikalaga mubo a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
